      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "Creating an instance of this class using this method is equivalent to calling [`init(player:templateItem:timeRange:)`](avplayerlooper/init(player:templateitem:timerange:).md) and passing a value of [`invalid`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTimeRange/invalid) for the `timeRange` parameter.",
      "ko": "이 메서드를 사용하여 이 클래스의 인스턴스를 생성하는 것은 [`init(player:templateItem:timeRange:)`](avplayerlooper/init(player:templateitem:timerange:).md)를 호출하고 `timeRange` 매개변수에 [`invalid`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTimeRange/invalid) 값을 전달하는 것과 같습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b06ff15ee10a217aab7d55177069f34cd735fb01a56f228170cb856d595190c1",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
